__{jvsv cinfriti}__


 cinse cin          sexual
                    x1 in activity/state x2 exhibits
                    sexuality/gender/sexual orientation x3 (ka) by
                    standard x4

                    ~np~[also: x1 courts/flirts; x3 could be a ka[((jbovlaste import: gender
                    or role]~/np~, ka~np~[attraction to a gender]~/np~, or ka~np~[type of
                    activity]~/np~, etc.; (adjective:) x1 is sexual/sexy; x1
                    is flirted with/courted by x2 (= __cinfriti__, cinjikca) lang en));
                    (cf. gletu, pinji, plibu, vibna, vlagi)

__{jvsv cinjikca}__


 cinse cin          sexual
                    x1 in activity/state x2 exhibits
                    sexuality/gender/sexual orientation x3 (ka) by
                    standard x4

                    ~np~[also: x1 courts/flirts; x3 could be a ka[((jbovlaste import: gender
                    or role]~/np~, ka~np~[attraction to a gender]~/np~, or ka~np~[type of
                    activity]~/np~, etc.; (adjective:) x1 is sexual/sexy; x1
