 risna              heart                ' cardiac '
                    x1 is a/the heart ~np~[body-part]~/np~ of x2; ~np~[emotional/shape
                    metaphors are NOT culturally neutral]~/np~

                    ~np~[(adjective:) x1 is cardiac; emotional 'heart'
