 tisna tis          fill                 ' stuff '
                    x1 (object) fills/becomes stuffed ~np~[up]~/np~/inflates/blows
                    up with material x2; x2 pours into x1

                    ~np~[implies some relative degree of fullness will result;
                    agentive filling (= tisyse'a, tisygau, tisyzu'e);
