                    ~np~[x1 swallows down [((jbovlaste import: food/drink]~/np~ x2 (= tulpinxe,
                    tulcti, ctitu'o (the latter two are more general -
                    for food or beverage); swallow/engulf (= galxycti,
                    __galxynerbi'o__, galxygre lang en)); (cf. citka, pinxe, galxe)

__{jvsv gensle}__


 jufra juf     ju'a sentence             ' phrase '
                    x1 (text) is a sentence/statement about x2
                    ~np~[topic/subject/predicate/focus]~/np~ in language x3

                    ~np~[phrase (= jufpau, suzrelvla, suzvla, __gensle__)]~/np~;
                    (cf. valsi, bangu, gerna, cusku, smuni)

__{jvsv gimpoi}__


 gismu gim     gi'u root word
                    x1 is a (Lojban) root word expressing relation x2
                    among argument roles x3, with affix(es) x4

                    ~np~[gismu list, if physical object (= (loi) gimste);
                    referring to the mental construct (e.g. propose adding
                    a new gismu to the gismu list = __gimpoi__, gimselcmi,
                    gimselste)]~/np~; (cf. cmavo, cmene, lujvo, smuni, sumti,
                    tanru, valsi)

