__{jvsv glajukpa}__


 jukpa jup          cook
                    x1 cooks/prepares food-for-eating x2 by recipe/method
                    x3 (process)

                    ~np~[cook with heat (= __glajukpa__, glaterjukpa), bake (=
                    tokyjukpa); fry (= rasyjukpa)]~/np~; (cf. cupra, bredi)

__{jvsv glaterjukpa}__


 jukpa jup          cook
                    x1 cooks/prepares food-for-eating x2 by recipe/method
                    x3 (process)

                    ~np~[cook with heat (= glajukpa, __glaterjukpa__), bake (=
                    tokyjukpa); fry (= rasyjukpa)]~/np~; (cf. cupra, bredi)

__{jvsv gligli}__


 glico gic gli      English
                    x1 is English/pertains to English-speaking culture
                    in aspect x2

                    ~np~[generally assume broadest sense of 'English';
                    may refer to 'English', pertaining to the
                    country/people/culture of England (normally requiring
                    constraint = gligu'e, or simply redundancy = __gligli__-);
                    British English, the norm language of the UK (=
                    __gligli__bau)]~/np~; (cf. brito which refers to the United
                    Kingdom as a whole or to the British empire, merko,
                    sralo, kadno, skoto)

__{jvsv gliglibau}__


 glico gic gli      English
                    x1 is English/pertains to English-speaking culture
                    in aspect x2

                    ~np~[generally assume broadest sense of 'English';
