__{jvsv grecta}__


 catlu     cta      look
                    x1 looks
                    at/examines/views/inspects/regards/watches/gazes at x2

                    ~np~[also look through (= __grecta__, ravycta, bacycta);
                    note that English "look" often means a more generic
                    "observe"]~/np~; (cf. jvinu, minra, simlu, viska, lanli,
                    zgana, setca, viska)

__{jvsv gritrukamni}__


 kamni              committee
                    x1 (mass) is a committee with task/purpose x2 of
                    body x3

                    ~np~[board of directors/trustees/cabinet (= trukamni,
                    __gritrukamni__)]~/np~ (cf. bende, kagni)

__{jvsv grumlo}__


 molki     mlo      mill
                    x1 is a mill/foundry/industrial plant/~np~[assembly line]~/np~
                    performing process x2

                    ~np~[(unlike fanri,) need not produce a product; grain
                    mill (= __grumlo__), grinding mill (= zalmlo, zalmlotci,
                    zalmloca'a)]~/np~; (cf. gasta, gurni, tirse, fanri, zalvi)

__{jvsv grupu'o}__


 purmo pum     pu'o powder
