                    ~np~[flour (= __grupu'o__, xripu'o)]~/np~; (cf. pulce, zalvi)

__{jvsv gu'etro}__


 jitro     tro      control
                    x1 has control over/harnesses/manages/directs/conducts
                    x2 in x3 (activity/event/performance)

                    ~np~[x2 are aspects/individuals controlled within
                    activity/event x3; manage (= selzuktro, selzukfu'e,
                    __gu'etro__, gunfu'e, xaktro, xakfu'e) (as distinct
                    from manager/boss = gunterbe'e, gunja'a, gunmi'e,
                    gunca'i)]~/np~; (cf. cmavo list ji'o, bapli, te bende,
                    gidva - which does not necessarily control or command,
                    jatna, macnu, minde, ponse, ralju, rinka, sazri,
                    turni, vlipa, xance, xlura)

